  "system": {
    "identifier": "binding-fury-bolting-sakura",
    "description": "<p>You close your defenses as you guard your body with your weapons. You gain a +2 bonus to your AC against the triggering attack and all attacks made against you until the beginning of your next turn. Additionally, each time a creature makes a melee attack against you for the duration, you can make a melee taijutsu attack against a creature in your weapons range, dealing your [Weapon damage] + 2d6 on a hit. If you have Fury, you can spend it to grant an allied creature within your Weapons range a +2 bonus to their AC until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Affected creature is disarmed on a hit.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: Affected creature must make a Constitution saving throw, becomes Bruised on a failed save.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d6.</p>",
